{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-05T00:33:47.236Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"0253287c7b07e97397888a5e","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-05T00:33:47.214Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Implemented trusted-policy loading, pre-tooling revocation, verified web-flow handling, complete paginated commit/count/head proofs, metadata allowlist and head-bound squash requests. Focused suite: 66 passed. Behavioral revert proof in a disposable copy: removing only the foreign-commit filter made 12 of 61 tests fail; restored suite passed. Read-only production-policy execution against real pm-context#211 refused its foreign addition; all mutation calls were receipts only. Older local gh lacks --slurp, so production uses --paginate with JSON-line output. Documented write-token requirements, first-release pin placeholders and the asynchronous GitHub auto-merge limitation. Full npm tests now running serially before coverage."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-05T00:33:47.236Z"}],"before_hash":"aefa5fb37a19e5786c091da40dacdc19fead7d25094b86f4f322742f40d456e9","after_hash":"ab4c129d3584f26e4425f95687a3999fdf48be033dccd042841950797e4aefe9","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"307d7f40e5b6cdaa5f7c4a41cfdcf84382b8a11a79a5108935a5e38c79182ab8"}
